name crimson-relay
scenario Crimson Relay Logistics runs a single-subnet regional freight depot. The Windows domain controller (dc01) provides AD DS and DNS for the depot; a second Windows host (win02) presents the depot's IIS HTTP intranet and FTP drop. The Linux tier carries an nginx web front end with an authoritative DNS service (web01) and a MySQL shipment-tracking database (db01). Defenders keep the scored services online and hunt planted misconfigurations across the mixed estate. No in-path firewall; remote access disabled for this practice run.
difficulty 4
remote_access 0

